<title>JAPAN: Japan 6-mth T-bill auction lowest price of 99.775.</title>
<headline>Japan 6-mth T-bill auction lowest price of 99.775.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Ministry of Finance said its auction on Thursday of 1.2 trillion yen of six-month Treasury bills produced the following results:</p>
<p>Lowest price     99.775  Stop rate     0.452 pct</p>
<p>Average price    99.780  Average yield 0.440 pct</p>
<p>Total bids	   4.2732  trillion yen</p>
<p>Accepted Bids	1.1997  trillion yen</p>
<p>Bid to cover ratio 3.56  times</p>
<p>Bids accepted at lowest price 21.4910 pct Issue date	 Sept 10 1996</p>
<p>Maturity    March 10 1997</p>
</text>
